d score across tests.</p></article><article class="pm-card"><h3 data-cx-en="Example question: a different work schedule" data-cx-zh="示例问题：工作安排发生变化">Example question: a different work schedule</h3><p data-cx-en="The example reader might ask which reported resources still fit a changed schedule. That situation is separately supplied by the example reader; the scores do not establish it as a fact." data-cx-zh="示例使用者可以观察：哪些自陈资源仍适合新的工作安排。处境由示例使用者另行提供，不是分数确立的事实。">The example reader might ask which reported resources still fit a changed schedule. That situation is separately supplied by the example reader; the scores do not establish it as a fact.</p></article></div><div class="pm-example"><p class="pm-kicker"><span data-cx-en="Public synthetic example · not your result" data-cx-zh="公开合成示例，不是你的结果">Public synthetic example · not your result</span></p><div><img height="550" width="700" class="pm-product-preview" alt="Six synthetic self-report positions; this is an example, not your assessment" src="/assets/customer-ui/media/page-consolidation-r1/profile-preview.svg"><div class="pe-axis-legend pm-thumb-legend"><div data-axis-ref="PRF-SIG-888B661E95E169D10D78D1C2"><b>A</b><span>适应与应对<span lang="en">Adaptation and coping</span></span><strong>50</strong></div><div data-axis-ref="PRF-SIG-97FFAEC628E7277C1AB312F9"><b>B</b><span>身体与生活方式<span lang="en">Body and lifestyle</span></span><strong>75</strong></div><div data-axis-ref="PRF-SIG-B2A887801487E1B01C5FB331"><b>C</b><span>认知导航<span lang="en">Cognitive navigation</span></span><strong>0</strong></div><div data-axis-ref="PRF-SIG-29ECC85664AAF3B12E367251"><b>D</b><span>情绪与社交调节<span lang="en">Emotional and social regulation</span></span><strong>25</strong></div><div data-axis-ref="PRF-SIG-ECA5D07741C32457FA57FD96"><b>E</b><span>财务能力<span lang="en">Financial capability</span></span><strong>100</strong></div><div data-axis-ref="PRF-SIG-2D6E0D4982B5F88230F54114"><b>F</b><span>意义与价值<span lang="en">Meaning and values</span></span><strong>0