-<details class="pm-reality-help"><summary data-cx-en="Help: working with a situation over time" data-cx-zh="帮助：怎样持续处理一个现实处境">Help: working with a situation over time</summary><section class="reality-structure cx-container" id="understanding-reality" aria-labelledby="reality-structure-title" data-reality-structure=""><header><p class="cx-eyebrow" data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="FROM SITUATION TO CONTINUITY" data-cx-zh="从处境到持续跟进">FROM SITUATION TO CONTINUITY</p><h2 id="reality-structure-title" data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="Understanding your current reality" data-cx-zh="如何理解你当前的现实">Understanding your current reality</h2><p data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="Start with what is happening. Keep facts, interpretations and unknowns distinct, compare directions, then return to see what changed." data-cx-zh="从正在发生的事情开始。分清事实、解释与未知，比较方向，再回来看看变化。">Start with what is happening. Keep facts, interpretations and unknowns distinct, compare directions, then return to see what changed.</p></header><div class="reality-structure__path" aria-hidden="true">01 → 02 → 03 → 04 → 05 ↺</div><article class="reality-structure__step" data-reality-structure-step="1"><div class="reality-structure__copy"><span class="reality-structure__number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3 data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="Start with what is happening now" data-cx-zh="从现在正在发生的事情开始">Start with what is happening now</h3><p data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="Describe the situation before choosing a report or an explanation." data-cx-zh="先说清处境，再考虑报告或解释。">Describe the situation before choosing a report or an explanation.</p><button type="button" class="cx-button cx-button--primary" data-reality-structure-start="" data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="Describe my situation" data-cx-zh="描述我的当前处境">Describe my situation</button></div><div class="reality-structure__visual"><div class="cx-reality-structure-start"><strong data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="Your situation, now" data-cx-zh="你此刻的处境">Your situation, now</strong><span class="cx-reality-structure-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><div class="cx-reality-structure-start__questions"><span data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="What is happening?" data-cx-zh="正在发生什么？">What is happening?</span><span data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="What changed recently?" data-cx-zh="最近有什么变化？">What changed recently?</span><span data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="What matters most now?" data-cx-zh="现在最重要的是什么？">What matters most now?</span></div></div></div></article><article class="reality-structure__step" data-reality-structure-step="2"><div class="reality-structure__copy"><span class="reality-structure__number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3 data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="Current reality is not one answer" data-cx-zh="当前现实不是一个答案">Current reality is not one answer</h3><p data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="Look at these five parts separately. Unknowns belong in the picture from the start." data-cx-zh="把这五个部分分开看。未知从一开始就属于现实的一部分。">Look at these five parts separately. Unknowns belong in the picture from the start.</p><button class="cx-button cx-button--secondary" type="button" data-reality-structure-tab="current" data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="Open Current Reality" data-cx-zh="查看当前现实">Open Current Reality</button></div><div class="reality-structure__visual"><div class="cx-reality-structure-components"><div class="cx-reality-structure-component"><span aria-hidden="true">◯</span><h4 data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="Situation" data-cx-zh="当前处境">Situation</h4><p data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="What is happening around you" data-cx-zh="你正在面对的情况">What is happening around you</p></div><div class="cx-reality-structure-component"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><h4 data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="Established facts" data-cx-zh="已建立事实">Established facts</h4><p data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="What has been established, with a source" data-cx-zh="有来源且已建立的事实">What has been established, with a source</p></div><div class="cx-reality-structure-component"><span aria-hidden="true">≋</span><h4 data-pis-copy="" data-cx-en="Evidence" data-cx-z